StyleTTS2 -- https://github.com/yl4579/StyleTTS2
Copyright (c) 2023 Aaron (Yinghao) Li
MIT License

ChiReSSD is a fine-tuning recipe and evaluation suite built on StyleTTS2. The
upstream source is not vendored here. `chiressd-setup` clones it at the pinned
commit 5cedc71c333f8d8b8551ca59378bdcc7af4c9529 and applies the patches in
src/chiressd/_upstream_patches/. Those patch files are derivative works of
MIT-licensed source and are released under the same MIT terms.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
StyleTTS2 LibriTTS checkpoint (2nd stage) -- yl4579
The base checkpoint that ChiReSSD fine-tunes from. Obtain it from the upstream release.

PL-BERT, JDCNet (pitch), ASRCNN (text aligner) weights
Obtained via the upstream StyleTTS2 clone. NOT redistributed here.

monotonic_align -- https://github.com/resemble-ai/monotonic_align
Installed as a dependency.

